  "tutorial.steelclash.on_join": "Shown every time you join a world; %s shows it again. Turn it off: Mods > Steel Clash > Config > helpOnJoin.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.title": "Steel Clash: controls",
  "tutorial.steelclash.attacks": "Attack: %s slash, %s second slash (left to right, if bound), %s overhead, %s stab. Scrolling up or down also overheads or stabs. Slashes alternate sides; turn while attacking to pick the side.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.heavy": "Hold an attack key for a heavy. During a windup press %s to feint, or another attack key to morph into it. Sprint into an attack to lunge.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.parry": "Hold %s to block (it slowly drains stamina). Attack after blocking a hit for a fast riposte, which also parries anyone else swinging at your front. With a shield in your offhand it raises the shield.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.counter": "Counter: answer an attack with the same attack type, just after it starts, and yours lands first (and parries other frontal hits while it swings). Get the type wrong at the last moment and you still block.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.kick": "%s kicks (or shield-bashes) to break a guard. %s jabs to interrupt a slow attack up close. %s dodges in the direction you move. %s uses the weapon special, %s throws your weapon.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.stamina": "Attacks, parries and blocks cost stamina. Parrying with no stamina left knocks your weapon out of your hand. Walk over it to pick it up.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.dummy": "Practise on a Training Dummy (carved pumpkin, hay bale and sticks). Sneak + use with an item to arm it, with an empty hand to switch mode: passive, parry, attack or spar.",
  "tutorial.steelclash.settings": "Rebind keys in Controls. Settings: Mods > Steel Clash > Config. /steelclash_debug draws the hitboxes.",
